{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/698040/extras/9fbce8c6740caefb1fd82ce2e247f0ce.avif?t=1726982102\" width=362 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Bounty is a metroidvania style action platformer. You play as Jekt, A Bounty Hunter commissioned with hunting down a rebel General named Volgat. Explore areas to gain new abilities and increase your stats so you can defeat powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/698040/extras/cb61b110875dd3a6564e32161c6e66b5.avif?t=1726982102\" width=280 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jekt has different abilities than the previous game's hero Trion. Jekt's new abilities include The Beam, Gliding, Rapid Shot among others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/698040/extras/fe4eeebeb955ada869c192c2a7cea267.avif?t=1726982102\" width=289 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A More In-depth Map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A New Framework So the Game Runs smoother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Characters and A New story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More User Optimization.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f8c758af6fb621c92b33b4ca9590e127b4a8fa39.jpg","localized_name":"Aya","name":"Aya","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/698040/f8c758af6fb621c92b33b4ca9590e127b4a8fa39.jpg"},{"icon":"c574afd87c52f6a849fedd9c435fecb117df4554.jpg","localized_name":"Beam","name":"Beam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps